# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
# Canonicalizes to non-www version and enforces trailing slashes

# Remove www subdomain: www.whatismyage.me → whatismyage.me (301)
https://www.whatismyage.me/*  https://whatismyage.me/:splat  301

# Blog post URLs: /blog/slug → /blog/slug/ (301)
/blog/:slug  /blog/:slug/  301

# Top-level pages: /privacy → /privacy/ etc.
/privacy  /privacy/  301
/about    /about/    301
/contact  /contact/  301
/blog     /blog/     301
